## Answer questions

**Q1** What is the Maryland county with the lowest median age, according to the ACS 2022 5-year estimates? You will need to find the variable for median age first.

**A1**

The lowest median age of any county is Prince George's (38.2)
```{r}
md_med_age <- get_acs(geography="county",
                      variable=c(medage= "B01002_001"),
                      state="MD",
                      year=2022)

md_med_age <- md_med_age |>
  arrange(desc(estimate)) |>
  top_n(20, estimate)
                  
                       
```

